<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI3152-DUPLICATE-ADMISSION-IDIOM>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI3152-DUPLICATE-ADMISSION-IDIOM" ;
  triage:title "ConnectionWorkerPool::dispatch duplicates DispatchWorkerPool::dispatch's bounded-admission retry idiom" ;
  triage:description "ConnectionWorkerPool::dispatch (local_ipc_transport.rs:282-310) hand-rolls a byte-for-byte duplicate of DispatchWorkerPool::dispatch's (request_worker.rs:107-146) bounded-admission retry idiom (sync_channel + try_send + 1ms-sleep retry + Disconnected->daemon_unavailable), including duplicated retry-interval constants. Recommend extracting one shared bounded-admission primitive instead of two independently-tunable copies." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "duplication" ;
  triage:severity "Important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-08-02T12:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AICH-S13 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-08-02T11:45:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-DUPLICATE-ADMISSION-IDIOM/OCC-1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI3152-DUPLICATE-ADMISSION-IDIOM/OCC-2> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-08-02T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:progressNote "M5-ADMISSION-QA-2 (PR #722 @ 5fc5e513): req-qa, arch-qa, and ruthless-boundary-qa independently confirmed the duplicated bounded-admission retry idiom was extracted into one shared primitive, send_with_bounded_admission<T>() in the new module crates/atm-daemon/src/local_ipc_transport/admission.rs (BOUNDED_ADMISSION_RETRY_INTERVAL + fn at lines 7/13-32). ConnectionWorkerPool::dispatch (local_ipc_transport.rs:288-306) and DispatchWorkerPool::dispatch (request_worker.rs:113-146) both now call the shared primitive instead of hand-rolling independent copies. No boundary leak. Closing as fixed." .

